WEBVTT

00:01.117 --> 00:03.737
I need you.

00:04.787 --> 00:06.777
I hope you'll keep 
lending me your strength.

00:19.587 --> 00:21.727
Dice Thrust!

00:41.607 --> 00:42.997
<i>Critical.</i>

01:00.657 --> 01:03.637
Golden Raana are worth a lot of EXP,

01:04.127 --> 01:07.637
but the best part is 
the valuable item drops.

01:08.497 --> 01:10.977
The drop rate is 50%.

01:33.737 --> 01:35.747
<i>Dazzling Raana Decorative Blade.</i>

01:34.747 --> 01:44.797
<b>Dazzling Raana Decorative Blade</b>

01:35.747 --> 01:40.607
<i>Attack: +12. 
Market price: 17,000,000 gold.</i>

01:35.837 --> 01:44.797
<b>Attack: +12
 Market Price: 17,000,000G
A glittering Raana short sword
 A hunk of high-purity Raana Gold</b>

01:40.607 --> 01:42.387
<i>A glittering Raana short sword.</i>

01:42.387 --> 01:44.797
<i>A hunk of high-purity Raana Gold.</i>

01:45.687 --> 01:48.847
We got a Dazzling Raana Decorative Blade!

02:26.427 --> 02:27.677
<b>Loading</b>

02:38.937 --> 02:40.237
<b>Loading</b>

02:51.577 --> 02:52.867
<b>Loading</b>

03:01.127 --> 03:01.877
<b>Loading</b>

03:03.377 --> 03:08.967
<b>Begin Adventure</b>

03:03.387 --> 03:08.967
<b>Begin Adventure</b>

03:20.107 --> 03:24.437
<b>Episode 8</b>

03:20.107 --> 03:24.437
<b>Wandering</b>

03:24.487 --> 03:29.817
W-Wow, we acquired 
a 1,700,000 gold item so easily.

03:31.707 --> 03:34.267
Hold on. You're missing a digit.

03:34.267 --> 03:35.807
You're one zero short.

03:35.807 --> 03:36.707
What?

03:36.707 --> 03:39.107
It's worth 17,000,000 gold.

03:42.877 --> 03:45.707
<b>Dazzling Raana Decorative Blade
 Attack: +12
 Market Price: 17,000,000G</b>

03:46.247 --> 03:50.427
One, ten, hundred, thousand,

03:50.427 --> 03:54.487
ten thousand, hundred thousand, million...

04:01.037 --> 04:07.437
My party kicked me over 
my share of a 2,000,000 gold item.

04:08.797 --> 04:10.707
Have you calmed down a little?

04:10.707 --> 04:12.777
Yes, somewhat.

04:12.777 --> 04:20.037
But I still can't believe we acquired 
such a valuable item so easily.

04:20.037 --> 04:25.047
Maybe that's odd for me to say 
after you set this up, but still...

04:28.547 --> 04:32.797
Carrying this rare item around 
will make us a target!

04:32.797 --> 04:35.527
Mr. Elymas, let's run away together!

04:35.527 --> 04:38.307
We can hide away in some remote place!

04:38.307 --> 04:43.257
Yes, that's what we should do. Yup, yup.

04:43.257 --> 04:45.917
Well... you're not wrong.

04:47.397 --> 04:49.357
We should get going.

04:51.097 --> 04:53.807
We'll farm one more before the sun sets.

04:54.777 --> 04:57.577
What? Another one?

05:07.087 --> 05:09.587
<b>3 Hours Later</b>

05:07.087 --> 05:08.787
<i>Three hours later.</i>

05:09.587 --> 05:10.757
Dice Thrust!

05:10.757 --> 05:11.717
<i>Miss.</i>

05:11.717 --> 05:13.137
Dice Thrust!

05:13.137 --> 05:13.967
<i>Miss.</i>

05:13.967 --> 05:15.347
Dice Thrust!

05:15.347 --> 05:16.307
<i>Miss.</i>

05:16.307 --> 05:17.467
Again!

05:17.467 --> 05:18.347
<i>Miss.</i>

05:18.347 --> 05:19.767
Dice Thrust!

05:19.767 --> 05:20.807
<i>Miss.</i>

05:21.487 --> 05:26.437
I'll get it this time! Dice Thrust!

05:28.897 --> 05:30.187
<i>Critical.</i>

05:38.557 --> 05:41.157
We did it, Ruche. That's our second one.

05:41.157 --> 05:43.457
<i>Level 33 reached.</i>

05:43.977 --> 05:45.097
Ruche?

05:51.367 --> 05:57.847
You missed a few times, but just imagine 
you're saving your luck for later.

06:00.527 --> 06:01.847
Thirty...

06:03.777 --> 06:07.067
Thirty-four million...

06:12.517 --> 06:13.447
Ruche?

06:13.747 --> 06:17.677
Pull yourself together, Ruche!

06:24.537 --> 06:26.797
Th-Thirty million...

06:26.797 --> 06:30.107
Ten times 3,000,000?

06:31.487 --> 06:36.217
Thanks to you, we got two 
Dazzling Raana Decorative Blades.

06:36.607 --> 06:43.547
We'll have to consider how best 
to use this money for our party.

06:44.227 --> 06:48.727
Y-You're right. We need to think 
about our future.

06:49.087 --> 06:52.787
But it still doesn't feel real.

06:53.927 --> 06:58.237
We'll need to consider how to spend 
our skill points given our equipment.

06:58.237 --> 07:03.997
Oh, right. I still have skill points 
from gaining all those levels.

07:03.997 --> 07:05.997
How should I spend them?

07:07.097 --> 07:10.747
You really shouldn't be 
showing that to people.

07:10.747 --> 07:14.047
There's no need to worry 
about that anymore.

07:14.047 --> 07:18.547
I owe you for getting me to this level.

07:18.547 --> 07:23.767
I wouldn't mind if you used me up 
and threw me away like a rag.

07:23.767 --> 07:27.607
<i>I really wish you did.</i>

07:31.497 --> 07:32.507
What is it?

07:41.257 --> 07:42.427
A voice?

07:44.167 --> 07:45.267
What voice?

07:46.687 --> 07:50.917
Did you hear a crying baby just now?

07:57.697 --> 07:59.557
A crying baby?

08:06.997 --> 08:08.177
Could it be?

08:12.227 --> 08:13.937
It's wandering.

08:14.357 --> 08:17.237
<b>Wandering</b>

08:17.897 --> 08:21.817
<i>A dungeon's boss 
or Dreamlord is its heart.</i>

08:22.117 --> 08:25.907
<b>Dreamlord</b>

08:22.427 --> 08:25.207
<i>Normally, it stays put 
deep inside the dungeon.</i>

08:25.907 --> 08:31.037
<i>But sometimes it wanders around 
the rest of the dungeon.</i>

08:33.037 --> 08:36.547
<b>Wandering</b>

08:33.037 --> 08:35.957
<i>That's known as wandering.</i>

08:36.547 --> 08:38.247
Wandering?

08:38.247 --> 08:41.547
Isn't this Dreamlord's 
recommended level 50?

08:41.547 --> 08:43.697
Isn't that bad news?

08:43.697 --> 08:48.117
We're fine. If we take the right steps, 
we can avoid it.

08:49.847 --> 08:53.477
We'll move away from 
the voice and towards the exit.

08:54.017 --> 08:56.497
The Dreamlord won't follow us outside.

08:56.497 --> 09:00.757
Really? That's a relief.

09:00.757 --> 09:04.527
<i>Yeah. It's that simple.</i>

09:05.377 --> 09:10.037
<i>We'll head to the exit 
and cash out back in town.</i>

09:10.037 --> 09:14.537
<i>That's where this adventure should end.</i>

09:14.587 --> 09:16.837
<b>But</b>

09:14.997 --> 09:15.867
<i>But...</i>

09:16.837 --> 09:18.337
Help!

09:21.837 --> 09:23.697
<i>I was naive.</i>

09:24.847 --> 09:30.637
A much stronger monster suddenly appeared!

09:42.097 --> 09:44.487
Are you okay? Hang in there!

09:42.107 --> 09:44.487
<i>This isn't a game.</i>

09:44.937 --> 09:46.777
What happened?

09:44.947 --> 09:47.677
<i>They'll never escape like that.</i>

09:47.227 --> 09:48.237
Deep in the dungeon...

09:48.237 --> 09:53.247
<i>If we flee now, 
these two will definitely die.</i>

10:04.047 --> 10:07.567
Ruche, take them outside!

10:08.287 --> 10:10.677
I'll keep the monster occupied!

10:11.157 --> 10:16.827
Okay, but not even you 
can handle a level 50 Dreamlord!

10:17.267 --> 10:19.217
I know its nature.

10:19.217 --> 10:22.777
I can buy time for you 
and escape by myself.

10:23.277 --> 10:24.527
Besides...

10:26.907 --> 10:30.667
it's a Heavy Knight's job 
to draw aggro.

10:33.167 --> 10:34.507
Mr. Elymas...

10:58.807 --> 11:00.607
There you are...

11:16.777 --> 11:18.397
Tin Knight.

11:22.777 --> 11:24.757
Help!

11:25.427 --> 11:28.917
A much stronger monster suddenly appeared!

11:31.027 --> 11:32.707
Are you okay?

11:31.027 --> 11:33.267
<i>This isn't a game.</i>

12:14.677 --> 12:16.557
I'll buy time for you.

12:16.927 --> 12:19.227
Ruche, take them and go.

12:19.557 --> 12:20.977
B-But...

12:20.977 --> 12:23.917
Th-Thank you so much.

12:31.567 --> 12:36.497
<b><b>Monster: Tin Knight</b></b>

12:37.097 --> 12:41.167
I see. It's damaged.

12:41.807 --> 12:44.307
The situation could be worse.

12:52.387 --> 12:56.517
My. Elymas, it's a powerful monster, 
but it's weakened.

12:56.807 --> 12:58.307
Let's defeat it together.

12:58.307 --> 13:00.207
No. We can't, Ruche.

13:00.687 --> 13:02.097
You have to run.

13:02.097 --> 13:03.017
But...

13:03.017 --> 13:06.347
The Tin Knight isn't the Dreamlord itself.

13:06.347 --> 13:08.687
That's just one of its minions.

13:09.817 --> 13:13.057
The actual Dreamlord will arrive soon.

13:29.077 --> 13:30.297
No way.

13:31.527 --> 13:35.097
Three level 40s?

13:35.607 --> 13:38.377
I'll be right behind you 
once I've bought some time.

13:38.377 --> 13:39.697
Y-You can't do this.

13:39.697 --> 13:42.957
I can't leave you to 
handle these by yourself.

13:42.957 --> 13:45.057
You invited me to join your party.

13:45.057 --> 13:47.567
Do I have to spell it out?

13:48.167 --> 13:52.367
I can't look out for dead weight 
while fighting these guys.

13:53.287 --> 13:54.567
You'd just get in the way.

14:04.577 --> 14:08.647
You're right. I'm sorry.

14:15.417 --> 14:18.647
Don't take too long, Mr. Elymas.

14:21.617 --> 14:23.777
<i>Three level 40s, huh?</i>

14:29.017 --> 14:34.667
<i>Ruche and I might've been able 
to take them out if she stayed.</i>

14:40.597 --> 14:41.537
<i>But...</i>

14:45.097 --> 14:47.317
<i>the Dreamlord is still out there.</i>

14:48.037 --> 14:53.547
<i>I told Ruche I'd draw them to me 
and flee, but that was a lie.</i>

14:54.297 --> 14:56.807
<i>As a Heavy Knight, I have no speed.</i>

14:57.967 --> 15:00.807
<i>I might be able to escape 
from Tin Knights.</i>

15:01.707 --> 15:05.457
<i>But running from a Dreamlord 
with magic attacks...</i>

15:07.227 --> 15:08.597
<i>is impossible.</i>

15:19.567 --> 15:22.477
<i>I'll defeat the Dreamlord here.</i>

15:24.447 --> 15:27.207
There you are, Dreamlord Embryo!

15:28.877 --> 15:33.207
<b>Dreamlord:\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hEmbryo</b>

15:34.057 --> 15:37.947
<i>The Embryo's stats are low 
for a level 50 monster.</i>

15:38.717 --> 15:42.217
<i>The problem is that 
I can't deal damage to it.</i>

15:42.657 --> 15:46.237
<i>Its flesh's Defense is unbelievably high.</i>

15:46.827 --> 15:49.487
<i>Only its eye can be damaged,</i>

15:50.967 --> 15:55.537
<i>and that requires ranged attacks.</i>

15:56.737 --> 15:57.787
<i>But...</i>

15:59.297 --> 16:04.797
<i>if it's a got a weakness, then even 
a low-level solo adventurer can beat it.</i>

16:02.987 --> 16:04.537
<b>Skill Trees: Heavy Knight</b>

16:02.987 --> 16:04.537
<b>Remaining Skill Points: 9</b>

16:02.987 --> 16:04.537
<b>Oath of the Heavy Armor</b>

16:02.987 --> 16:04.537
<b>Defense Booster</b>

16:02.987 --> 16:04.537
<b>Beginner Swordsmanship</b>

16:04.797 --> 16:07.997
<i>Oath of the Heavy Armor 
has reached level 27.</i>

16:04.827 --> 16:07.997
<b>Oath of the Heavy Armor has reached level 27
Shield Bash skill has been acquired</b>

16:07.997 --> 16:11.007
<i>Shield Bash skill has been acquired.</i>

16:12.137 --> 16:15.257
Let's go, Embryo!

16:15.877 --> 16:20.257
Don't worry, I won't run! 
I'll fight you head-on!

16:24.357 --> 16:27.727
Shield... Bash!

16:32.607 --> 16:40.357
<b>Shield Bash [Common Skill]
 Push an enemy with a shield and knock them back</b>

16:33.297 --> 16:36.037
<i>Skill: Shield Bash.</i>

16:36.037 --> 16:39.527
<i>Push an enemy with a shield 
and knock them back.</i>

16:41.507 --> 16:44.587
<i>I'm glad to have this skill 
that lets me split up my enemies.</i>

16:47.407 --> 16:48.347
Parry!

16:49.437 --> 16:50.367
Disarm!

16:52.877 --> 16:56.767
<i>The Embryo won't use either of its magic 
attacks, Sylph Cutter and Thunderstorm,</i>

16:56.767 --> 17:00.017
<i>if it would hit the Tin Knights.</i>

17:02.217 --> 17:04.467
<i>I can focus on the Tin Knights.</i>

17:10.857 --> 17:12.017
Disarm!

17:12.147 --> 17:16.267
<b>Disarm</b>

17:12.147 --> 17:16.267
<b>Disarm</b>

17:12.867 --> 17:14.347
<i>That's the second hit.</i>

17:15.217 --> 17:18.007
<i>It's only been 47 seconds 
since the first Disarm.</i>

17:20.897 --> 17:22.907
<i>I've met the activation conditions.</i>

17:28.327 --> 17:30.657
<b>Rampart Reflection</b>

17:28.337 --> 17:30.097
<i>Rampart Reflection!</i>

17:31.537 --> 17:33.667
<b>Rampart Reflection</b>

17:31.537 --> 17:33.267
<i>Rampart Reflection!</i>

17:34.077 --> 17:36.167
<i>The real battle starts now.</i>

17:38.007 --> 17:39.667
<i>That's one down.</i>

17:43.217 --> 17:44.227
<i>But...</i>

17:47.347 --> 17:49.177
<b>Repair</b>

18:08.577 --> 18:13.617
<i>The Tin Knights will keep reviving 
unless I defeat the Embryo.</i>

18:14.707 --> 18:20.917
<i>But it exposes its eye when it uses magic.</i>

18:23.887 --> 18:25.577
Take this!

18:31.097 --> 18:34.227
<i>That's my only attack that reaches it.</i>

18:34.597 --> 18:36.457
<i>Earth Magic Stone.</i>

18:36.457 --> 18:40.607
<i>Spend MP to fire 
countless needles of earth.</i>

18:37.187 --> 18:40.607
<b>Earth Magic Stone Patchwork Bear
Spend MP to fire countless needles of earth</b>

18:42.927 --> 18:46.607
<i>I'll use the Tin Knight 
to block its Sylph Cutter.</i>

18:47.217 --> 18:51.737
<i>As long as I don't screw this up, 
I won't be one-shot.</i>

18:55.747 --> 18:57.217
Shield Bash!

19:00.517 --> 19:01.267
What?!

19:04.637 --> 19:05.547
Vital Slice!

19:10.897 --> 19:13.917
<i>They're learning.</i>

19:14.387 --> 19:19.647
<i>In </i>Magic World<i>, monsters 
couldn't adapt to player skills.</i>

19:22.007 --> 19:26.577
<i>They've clearly learned 
what Shield Bash looks like.</i>

19:29.457 --> 19:31.657
This isn't unexpected.

19:32.587 --> 19:36.747
<i>But this makes beating 
the Embryo way harder.</i>

19:37.717 --> 19:41.617
<i>I need to throw three more 
Magic Stones to beat it,</i>

19:41.617 --> 19:44.667
<i>and Dreamlords regenerate quickly.</i>

19:45.187 --> 19:47.677
<i>If I take too long, I'm screwed.</i>

19:51.967 --> 19:56.477
<i>No way. It shouldn't use Sylph Cutter 
with this positioning.</i>

19:57.097 --> 19:58.227
<b>Sylph Cutter</b>

20:02.567 --> 20:03.747
<i>It's no use.</i>

20:05.027 --> 20:06.367
<i>I can't avoid it.</i>

20:36.047 --> 20:37.967
<i>My consciousness is fading.</i>

20:40.717 --> 20:43.467
<i>My heart is racing.</i>

20:44.987 --> 20:47.827
<i>My legs feel weak.</i>

20:52.317 --> 20:55.487
<b>Status Effect
<b> Stunned</b></b>

20:52.577 --> 20:54.897
<i>Status effect: Stunned.</i>

20:57.257 --> 21:01.827
<i>I see. Well, a stun is fatal 
in this situation.</i>

21:03.557 --> 21:09.427
<i>Maybe my starting Luck value was low.</i>

21:12.437 --> 21:15.827
I should've asked Ruche to stay.

21:16.347 --> 21:18.347
Let's defeat it together.

21:28.487 --> 21:30.207
You called?

21:35.267 --> 21:37.907
Thanks for choosing me.

21:55.967 --> 21:59.467
<b>Translator:
Sho Stifler

Timer:
Krzysztof Kunc

Editor:
Salem Alabanza

Quality Control:
Gabriella Alabanza

Final Quality Control:
Sriram Gurunathan</b>

23:10.417 --> 23:12.107
<i>I wasn't overconfident.</i>

23:12.107 --> 23:15.257
<i>I fought the best I could've.</i>

23:15.257 --> 23:20.377
<i>But I couldn't quite beat 
the Embryo Dreamlord.</i>

23:20.717 --> 23:22.767
<i>It was Ruche who saved me.</i>

23:23.167 --> 23:25.907
<i>She put herself in danger 
by coming to rescue me.</i>

23:26.347 --> 23:31.247
<i>So I—we'll defeat the Embryo together.</i>

23:31.247 --> 23:33.567
<i>We'll beat this dungeon.</i>

23:33.567 --> 23:35.457
<i>Next time, "Dreamlord."</i>

23:35.897 --> 23:39.367
<i>Far more than I imagined, Ruche is...</i>
